# CreateJavadocIndex decides that a line is a glob by looking for "*", but it passes the
# line to Files.newDirectoryStream, whose glob syntax also includes "?", "[...]", and
# "{...}".  A line that uses only those other metacharacters is treated as a file name.
api/index-?.html
api/index-[12].html
api/index-{1,2}.html
api/index-*.html
